    1327/    16E2 :                     		; The above code does not properly 'pop' the 16th PLC entry.
    1328/    16E2 :                     		; Because of this, occupying the 16th slot will cause it to
    1329/    16E2 :                     		; be repeatedly decompressed infinitely.
    1330/    16E2 :                     		; Granted, this could be conisdered more of an optimisation
    1331/    16E2 :                     		; than a bug: treating the 16th entry as a dummy that
    1332/    16E2 :                     		; should never be occupied makes this code unnecessary.
    1333/    16E2 :                     		; Still, the overhead of this code is minimal.
