(1)  624/    7188 :                     		; Floor the coordinates to the nearest pair of tiles (the size of a block).
(1)  625/    7188 :                     		; Also note that this wraps the value to the size of the plane:
(1)  626/    7188 :                     		; The plane is 64*8 wide, so wrap at $100, and it's 32*8 tall, so wrap at $200
