(1)  344/   17538 :                     		; Each sub-object deletes itself when it detects that its
(1)  345/   17538 :                     		; parent is going to delete itself. This mostly works, but
(1)  346/   17538 :                     		; does cause the sub-object to linger for one frame longer
(1)  347/   17538 :                     		; than it should, which is why rolling into a Caterkiller
(1)  348/   17538 :                     		; at high speed causes Sonic to be hurt.
(1)  349/   17538 :                     
(1)  350/   17538 :                     		; Has the head been destroyed?
